                    "recipe `{}` fires artifact `{name}` at `{}`, which could not be fired: \\
                     {detail}",
                    recipe.name, artifact.address
                ),
            ));
        }
    };

    let expected = match VerdictRecord::new(expecting, observed.layer(), observed.observed_bytes())
    {
